	----------------------------------
		1. tiny - used for the applications where you know the number of records will be relatively small. 
					Example - quantity of products, Ratings/Scores, Status codes etc. Storage Efficiency and Ranging Suitability.
		2. smallint, mediumint, int, bigint
	
